<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_d30b2e95fb9d7d7778de8f39f87fde424e1edcdcec29e5931d37a4644749a1db_n0060/tu_0001> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Comprehensive evaluation, using imaging studies, exercise stress test and Holter monitoring, is recommended following recovery from acute myocarditis to assess the risk of exercise-related SCD." .
